      "content": "okay i think i get the basic physics of it now. but you keep using words like \"magic\" and \"dance\" to describe it. can you just give me a more technical breakdown of the pressure differential? like, how exactly does that curved top surface change the air velocity in a way that's mathematically consistent with Bernoulli?",
